Nauju kontaktu importas i storage

isextractinam emailus i nauji_emailai.txt (email per line)
tada padarom sortinima kad neliktu duplikatu (ignore case, only unique)
sort -fu -o nauji_emailai_sorted.txt nauji_emailai.txt
mv nauji_emailai_sorted.txt nauji_emailai.txt

countinam skaitiklius pagal sita faila

./storage --count-data-from --file nauji_emailai.txt

istrinam viska is providers/
paleidziam kad suimportuotu i sql

./storage --extract-providers --file nauji_emailai.txt



